**Open-case eligibility holds, with no blocker.** I searched for a podcast, a long-form profile and Purple Hearts press and found none. The one source research skipped, the People interview, is a single interview rather than a deep record. The title, description and FAQs don't overstate confidence, and the similarity check didn't trip.

